{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2023-03-07 05:45:00', 'title': 'IBM ALERT: THE KLEIN LAW FIRM ANNOUNCES A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF MARCH 14, 2023 IN THE CLASS ACTION FILED ON BEHALF OF INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS MACHINES CORPORATION SHAREHOLDERS', 'text': 'NEW YORK , MARCH 7, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE KLEIN LAW FIRM ANNOUNCES THAT A CLASS ACTION COMPLAINT HAS BEEN FILED ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS OF INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS MACHINES CORPORATION (NYSE: IBM) ALLEGING THAT THE COMPANY VIOLATED FEDERAL SECURITIES LAWS. CLASS PERIOD: JANUARY 18, 2018 TO OCTOBER 16, 2018 LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE: MARCH 14, 2023 NO OBLIGATION OR COST TO YOU.'}